    "waitTime": 1300,
    "bgEffectTime": 800
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──ごめんな、サイン書いてもらうのに\r\nこんなところで",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "bgm": "090",
    "se": "1278"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001019010080,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "いえ……\r\nちょうど、書き終わりました",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200101901/2001019010080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お、ありがとう\r\n確認しておくよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "もうすぐお昼だからさ、よかったらランチでもどうだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001019010090,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "ほわ……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200101901/2001019010090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "午後からイベントの顔合わせがあるし\r\n打ち合わせも兼ねて。ごちそうするよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "eye_right",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s3",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "id": 2001019010100,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "……えっと……いいんでしょうか……\r\n……ご迷惑でなければ、ご一緒はしたいんですけれど……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200101901/2001019010100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺が誘ってるんだから気にしなくていい\r\n……いや、無理をして俺に付き合う必要もないんだが……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001019010110,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "い、いえ……そんな……っ\r\n誘ってくださって、とてもうれしいです……っ",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_trouble",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200101901/2001019010110"
  },
  {
    "id": 2001019010120,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "うれしいんですけど……ただ……\r\n……ごちそうになってしまっていいのかなって……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200101901/2001019010120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、なんだ\r\nそういうことか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "真乃に断りづらくさせたかって心配したから\r\n安心したよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2800
  },
  {
